    {
      "name": "Certificate Telemetry",
      "description": "Leaf cert, mesh CA, and agent TLS cert expiry \u2014 empirically Enterprise-only on Consul today",
      "widgets": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "layout": {
            "column": 1,
            "height": 4,
            "row": 1,
            "width": 12
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.markdown"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "text": "# Certificate Telemetry\n\nConsul added per-service leaf-certificate expiry/renewal-failure telemetry and mesh CA expiry gauges (`consul.leaf-certs.cert_expiry`, `cert_renewal_failure`, `mesh.active-root-ca.expiry`, `mesh.active-signing-ca.expiry`, `agent.tls.cert.expiry`). This fork maps all of them (`ConsulCertSample`, plus gauges on `ConsulAgentSample`/`ConsulDatacenterSample`).\n\n**These widgets are expected to show no data on this environment.** Tested empirically against three real OSS Consul builds (1.20.5, 2.0.4, 2.1.0-rc1) \u2014 none emit these gauges, despite the changelog not marking the feature `(Enterprise Only)`. In practice it appears Enterprise-gated. The mapping is kept because it's harmless on OSS (matches nothing, logs at debug level) and will start populating automatically if run against Consul Enterprise with this feature, or if it ships in a future OSS release. Agent TLS cert expiry additionally requires the agent's own HTTP/RPC TLS to be enabled, independent of the Enterprise gating above."
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Leaf Cert Samples (Enterprise Consul only)",
          "layout": {
            "column": 1,
            "height": 3,
            "row": 5,
            "width": 4
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.billboard"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountId": 1015429,
                "query": "SELECT count(*) FROM ConsulCertSample SINCE 30 minutes ago"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Mesh Root CA Expiry (days)",
          "layout": {
            "column": 5,
            "height": 3,
            "row": 5,
            "width": 4
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.billboard"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountId": 1015429,
                "query": "SELECT latest(mesh.activeRootCAExpiryInSeconds)/86400 FROM ConsulDatacenterSample SINCE 60 minutes ago"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Mesh Signing CA Expiry (days)",
          "layout": {
            "column": 9,
            "height": 3,
            "row": 5,
            "width": 4
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.billboard"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountId": 1015429,
                "query": "SELECT latest(mesh.activeSigningCAExpiryInSeconds)/86400 FROM ConsulDatacenterSample SINCE 60 minutes ago"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Leaf Certificates \u2014 Current Expiry",
          "layout": {
            "column": 1,
            "height": 4,
            "row": 8,
            "width": 6
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.table"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountId": 1015429,
                "query": "SELECT datacenter, namespace, service, kind, cert.expiryInSeconds FROM ConsulCertSample WHERE cert.expiryInSeconds IS NOT NULL SINCE 30 minutes ago LIMIT 50"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Leaf Cert Renewal Failures",
          "layout": {
            "column": 7,
            "height": 4,
            "row": 8,
            "width": 6
          },
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.table"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountId": 1015429,
                "query": "SELECT datacenter, namespace, service, kind FROM ConsulCertSample WHERE cert.renewalFailing IS NOT NULL SINCE 30 minutes ago LIMIT 50"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Agent TLS Cert Expiry (days)",
